# Unit07
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit07核心词汇

equivalent/ɪˈkwɪvələnt/等同的/One mile is roughly equivalent to 1.6 kilometers.
era/ˈɪrə/时代/We are living in the digital era.
erode/ɪˈroʊd/侵蚀/The cliff has been eroded by the sea over centuries.
essential/ɪˈsenʃl/必要的/Water is essential for life.
establish/ɪˈstæblɪʃ/建立/The university was established in 1900.
estimate/ˈestɪmeɪt/估计/The cost is estimated at one million dollars.
evaluate/ɪˈvæljueɪt/评估/We need to evaluate the effectiveness of the program.
evidence/ˈevɪdəns/证据/There is strong evidence to support the theory.
evolution/ˌevəˈluːʃn/进化/The theory of evolution was proposed by Darwin.
evolve/ɪˈvɑːlv/进化/Technology continues to evolve rapidly.
exaggerate/ɪɡˈzædʒəreɪt/夸大/He tends to exaggerate his achievements.
exceed/ɪkˈsiːd/超过/Sales exceeded expectations this year.
exception/ɪkˈsepʃn/例外/Everyone must follow the rules; there are no exceptions.
excessive/ɪkˈsesɪv/过度的/Excessive drinking is harmful to health.
exclude/ɪkˈskluːd/排除/The price excludes tax and delivery fees.
execute/ˈeksɪkjuːt/执行/The plan was executed perfectly.
exert/ɪɡˈzɜːrt/施加/He exerted great influence on the decision.
exhaust/ɪɡˈzɔːst/使筋疲力尽/The long hike exhausted everyone.
exhibit/ɪɡˈzɪbɪt/展览/The museum exhibits rare paintings.
expand/ɪkˈspænd/扩展/The company plans to expand into Asian markets.
expense/ɪkˈspens/费用/Travel expenses will be reimbursed.
explicit/ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/明确的/The instructions are very explicit.
exploit/ɪkˈsplɔɪt/开发；剥削/We should exploit renewable energy sources.
explore/ɪkˈsplɔːr/探索/They explored the ancient ruins together.
export/ɪkˈspɔːrt/出口/The country exports oil to many nations.
expose/ɪkˈspoʊz/暴露/The report exposed the corruption in the government.
extend/ɪkˈstend/延长/The deadline has been extended by one week.
extent/ɪkˈstent/程度/To what extent do you agree with this statement?
external/ɪkˈstɜːrnl/外部的/External factors can affect the outcome.
extract/ɪkˈstrækt/提取/They extracted oil from the ground.
extraordinary/ɪkˈstrɔːrdneri/非凡的/She has extraordinary talent in music.
extreme/ɪkˈstriːm/极端的/The region experiences extreme weather conditions.
fabric/ˈfæbrɪk/织物；结构/The fabric of society is changing.
facilitate/fəˈsɪlɪteɪt/促进/Technology facilitates communication between people.
factor/ˈfæktər/因素/Price is an important factor in buying decisions.
faculty/ˈfækəlti/全体教员/She is a member of the faculty.
feature/ˈfiːtʃər/特征/The phone has many new features.
federal/ˈfedərəl/联邦的/The federal government passed a new law.
fierce/fɪrs/激烈的/Competition for the job is fierce.
figure/ˈfɪɡjər/数字；人物/She is an important figure in the field.
finance/ˈfaɪnæns/财政/She works in the finance department.
fine/faɪn/罚款/He was fined for breaking the traffic rule.
firm/fɜːrm/坚固的；公司/He works for a consulting firm.
flexible/ˈfleksəbl/灵活的/We need a more flexible approach.
flock/flɑːk/群/A flock of birds flew across the sky.
flourish/ˈflɜːrɪʃ/繁荣/The business has flourished in recent years.
fluctuate/ˈflʌktʃueɪt/波动/Prices fluctuate throughout the year.
focus/ˈfoʊkəs/焦点/Please focus on the main issue.
forbid/fərˈbɪd/禁止/Smoking is forbidden in public places.
forecast/ˈfɔːrkæst/预测/The weather forecast predicts rain tomorrow.
